WEBVTT

00:01:38.720 --> 00:01:40.080
I know this person.

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:42.680
He's all brawn and no brains.

00:01:43.240 --> 00:01:44.520
I have my own ways.

00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:47.360
Okay.

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:49.250
I'll leave it to you.

00:01:49.880 --> 00:01:50.640
Remember.

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:53.160
If you can't convince him,

00:01:54.400 --> 00:01:55.880
you will die with him.

00:01:58.400 --> 00:01:59.240
Yes.

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:09.460
I didn't expect it.

00:02:09.639 --> 00:02:12.320
I didn't expect Tianyuan Zhengxiong to return halfway.

00:02:12.320 --> 00:02:14.120
He caught us off guard.

00:02:17.720 --> 00:02:19.720
Chief Wu hasn't returned yet.

00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:23.160
I'm afraid he's in danger.

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:26.400
Baozi, where is Liu Banjin?

00:02:27.840 --> 00:02:29.760
To cover our safe retreat,

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:32.520
Master Liu stayed in Qinglong Stronghold.

00:02:32.560 --> 00:02:35.160
I think he knows the secret passage quite well.

00:02:36.160 --> 00:02:38.040
I hope he will be fine.

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:42.160
I hope so.

00:02:43.280 --> 00:02:44.120
Baozi.

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:46.400
Something happened.

00:02:56.960 --> 00:02:58.079
Xiaoni is missing.

00:02:58.480 --> 00:02:59.680
When did this happen?

00:03:00.840 --> 00:03:03.360
Probably when I was changing Yuanshangfei's dressing.

00:03:03.360 --> 00:03:04.960
She was sleeping all day today,

00:03:04.960 --> 00:03:06.160
so I didn't pay much attention.

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:07.160
When you just got back,

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:09.820
Ying'er asked, and then I realized she was gone.

00:03:11.280 --> 00:03:12.880
The treasure map is gone too.

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:36.360
Did Xiaoni know about the treasure map?

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:37.440
I didn't tell her,

00:03:37.760 --> 00:03:39.360
but she saw that parchment.

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:42.760
I only said it was Second Uncle Huo's relic,

00:03:43.760 --> 00:03:46.420
and she even specifically helped me put it away.

00:03:52.079 --> 00:03:54.079
Could Xiaoni have taken it?

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:08.480
Major Tahara.

00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:10.960
A woman is outside saying her surname is He.

00:04:11.160 --> 00:04:12.290
She wants to see you.

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:15.280
Surname He?

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:16.240
Yes.

00:04:18.959 --> 00:04:20.560
Quick, bring her in.

00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:21.560
Yes, sir.

00:04:44.560 --> 00:04:46.240
So it's Miss He.

00:04:46.560 --> 00:04:48.159
I hope you've been well.

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:51.520
Does your word still count?

00:04:51.840 --> 00:04:53.120
Of course it does.

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:55.680
As long as you get what I want,

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:58.930
I will let your father go so you can run away together.

00:04:59.640 --> 00:05:00.900
I want to see my father.

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:02.080
Okay.

00:05:02.760 --> 00:05:04.240
Give me the item first,

00:05:04.520 --> 00:05:06.520
and I'll take you to see your father.

00:05:29.320 --> 00:05:30.880
I finally

00:05:31.400 --> 00:05:33.320
got it.

00:05:35.880 --> 00:05:36.760
Men!

00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:39.600
Major.

00:05:39.640 --> 00:05:40.360
Go quickly

00:05:40.560 --> 00:05:42.000
and invite Professor Takeshita here.

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:42.840
Yes, sir.

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:50.040
I have done what I promised you.

00:05:50.560 --> 00:05:52.220
What about your promise to me?

00:05:55.800 --> 00:05:57.730
I promised not to kill your father,

00:05:57.840 --> 00:05:59.280
and I kept my word.

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:02.920
If you want your father to live,

00:06:03.240 --> 00:06:05.440
steal that map and give it to me.

00:06:05.720 --> 00:06:08.720
I'll guarantee your safety

00:06:09.440 --> 00:06:10.880
and reunite you.

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:17.560
You clearly said

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:18.600
that if I gave you the map,

00:06:18.600 --> 00:06:20.400
you would let me and my father go.

00:06:21.520 --> 00:06:22.760
You broke your promise.

00:06:22.760 --> 00:06:23.890
Give me back the map.

00:06:25.640 --> 00:06:26.440
Give it back.

00:06:26.640 --> 00:06:28.120
Give it back.

00:06:32.960 --> 00:06:33.840
Guards!

00:06:44.159 --> 00:06:45.360
Tian,

00:06:46.720 --> 00:06:47.760
you lied to me.

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:50.560
To save my father,

00:06:51.360 --> 00:06:53.680
I betrayed everyone.

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:56.120
Now,

00:06:56.720 --> 00:06:59.320
I have nothing left.

00:07:02.680 --> 00:07:05.400
You caused all of this.

00:07:05.720 --> 00:07:07.000
It's all your fault.

00:07:07.560 --> 00:07:09.600
I'll kill you.

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:11.800
Let me go! I'll kill you!

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:15.040
You lied to me!

00:07:15.440 --> 00:07:15.920
Go!

00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:17.960
Bastard! I'll kill you!

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:20.160
Let me go! I'll kill you!

00:07:20.440 --> 00:07:21.800
Let me go!

00:07:33.400 --> 00:07:37.800
This map is different from the first two.

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:40.240
It looks quite strange.

00:07:41.320 --> 00:07:42.680
Apart from being blank,

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:45.440
it only has a few holes.

00:07:45.760 --> 00:07:48.560
Was it intentionally destroyed?

00:07:52.840 --> 00:07:54.370
That shouldn't be the case.

00:07:54.880 --> 00:07:56.080
That girl said

00:07:56.560 --> 00:07:58.880
she stole it from Shangguan Ying.

00:07:59.640 --> 00:08:01.080
If it really was damaged,

00:08:01.600 --> 00:08:03.600
there'd be no use in them keeping it.

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:07.220
Then this third map is completely blank.

00:08:07.480 --> 00:08:10.160
What does it mean?

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:17.720
Takeshita.

00:08:18.880 --> 00:08:22.800
I believe this map must be real.

00:08:23.840 --> 00:08:26.040
She wouldn't dare use her father's life

00:08:26.240 --> 00:08:27.640
to play such a joke.

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:32.000
The first two maps combine into one.

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:33.640
This third map,

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:35.500
apart from being blank

00:08:35.640 --> 00:08:37.159
and having a few holes,

00:08:37.919 --> 00:08:41.280
has no connection to the first two.

00:08:41.840 --> 00:08:43.240
It must be fake.

00:08:55.560 --> 00:08:59.760
Could I have been tricked by them again?

00:09:04.200 --> 00:09:05.320
Bastard!

00:09:21.720 --> 00:09:23.720
Tahara, come take a look.

00:09:28.280 --> 00:09:30.240
There are words in this cave.

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:35.960
Daifeng.

00:09:37.240 --> 00:09:38.240
Five li.

00:09:38.600 --> 00:09:39.360
South.

00:09:40.440 --> 00:09:41.600
Toad Cave.

00:09:49.240 --> 00:09:50.880
What does this mean?

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:54.480
According to Chinese writing habits,

00:09:55.240 --> 00:09:58.240
the sequence should be:

00:09:58.640 --> 00:10:00.760
South of Daifeng,

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:03.480
five li, Toad Cave.

00:10:08.200 --> 00:10:09.280
Daifeng.

00:10:10.440 --> 00:10:11.320
South.

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:13.000
Five li.

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:15.160
Toad Cave.

00:11:10.800 --> 00:11:11.640
Major.

00:11:12.360 --> 00:11:13.840
We caught a shepherd.

00:11:14.240 --> 00:11:14.960
Go.

00:11:24.840 --> 00:11:26.800
Old man, let me ask you.

00:11:27.320 --> 00:11:28.240
Is there

00:11:28.640 --> 00:11:30.600
a place called Toad Cave nearby?

00:11:33.640 --> 00:11:35.320
Don't be afraid, old man.

00:11:35.520 --> 00:11:37.560
Tell me, and I'll let you go home.

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:40.320
Sir, I really don't know.

00:11:40.960 --> 00:11:42.720
Do you live in a nearby village?

00:11:42.920 --> 00:11:44.280
I do live in the village.

00:11:44.520 --> 00:11:46.920
My family has lived there for generations.

00:11:47.520 --> 00:11:49.180
Is this place called Daifeng?

00:11:49.400 --> 00:11:51.120
Yes, it's Daifeng.

00:11:51.840 --> 00:11:55.040
There is a Toad Cave within five li south of Daifeng.

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:56.680
Don't you know?

00:11:57.600 --> 00:11:59.640
There is a cave ahead.

00:12:00.520 --> 00:12:03.080
We locals call it Chanchu Cave.

00:12:04.920 --> 00:12:05.920
Chanchu Cave.

00:12:06.320 --> 00:12:08.560
Tahara, what is Chanchu?

00:12:09.840 --> 00:12:10.920
To the Chinese,

00:12:11.240 --> 00:12:13.320
toad and Chanchu are the same animal.

00:12:13.600 --> 00:12:16.360
Toad is colloquial, and Chanchu is formal.

00:12:17.480 --> 00:12:18.480
That's great.

00:12:18.840 --> 00:12:20.120
We finally found it.

00:12:23.640 --> 00:12:25.370
Thank you, sir. Thank you, sir.

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:28.960
Fall in!

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:34.440
Go.

00:12:55.680 --> 00:12:56.680
Come.

00:13:46.480 --> 00:13:49.200
We've looked around for ages and found nothing.

00:13:49.960 --> 00:13:52.690
It doesn't look like a place where gold is hidden.

00:13:52.880 --> 00:13:56.600
Could this gold treasure actually be a gold mine?

00:13:57.520 --> 00:13:58.400
A gold mine?

00:13:58.720 --> 00:13:59.320
Yeah.

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:01.360
This doesn't look like a treasure trove.

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:02.890
It doesn't even have a door.

00:14:03.200 --> 00:14:04.860
If it were a place to hide gold,

00:14:05.240 --> 00:14:07.300
there would at least be a secret room.

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:09.080
But there are absolutely no signs

00:14:09.080 --> 00:14:11.080
of artificial construction here.

00:14:12.600 --> 00:14:14.060
Let's look further ahead.

00:14:14.280 --> 00:14:15.740
If it really is a gold mine,

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:17.940
compared to finding hidden gold,

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:19.690
it would be much more valuable.

00:15:10.120 --> 00:15:11.000
Mr. Tahara.

00:15:13.280 --> 00:15:14.280
It's gold.

00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:26.040
Great.

00:15:27.800 --> 00:15:29.480
This is a gold mine.

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:31.860
The gold content is very high.

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:37.760
I finally found it.

00:15:38.280 --> 00:15:39.720
I finally found it.

00:15:51.200 --> 00:15:54.320
Officer, please don't arrest him. Don't arrest him.

00:15:59.600 --> 00:16:01.320
I won't go. Don't arrest me.

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:04.280
Hurry up.

00:16:08.880 --> 00:16:09.680
Go over there.

00:16:10.600 --> 00:16:11.520
Hurry.

00:16:17.480 --> 00:16:19.940
You still need to be careful with your wound.

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:20.720
It's fine.

00:16:20.920 --> 00:16:22.120
Didn't the doctor just say

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:23.380
it's nothing serious?

00:16:26.640 --> 00:16:27.400
Hurry up.

00:16:29.120 --> 00:16:29.840
Get up.

00:16:31.360 --> 00:16:32.420
Don't be reckless.

00:16:33.040 --> 00:16:35.370
There are Japanese soldiers everywhere.

00:16:35.840 --> 00:16:37.100
But we can't just watch

00:16:37.120 --> 00:16:38.780
them arrest innocent people.

00:16:39.200 --> 00:16:40.520
They are arresting people everywhere today.

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:41.450
It's so unusual.

00:16:41.760 --> 00:16:42.560
Let's follow them

00:16:42.560 --> 00:16:44.020
and see what they're up to.

00:16:44.120 --> 00:16:44.840
Okay.

00:17:09.040 --> 00:17:09.839
Hurry up.

00:17:10.359 --> 00:17:11.240
Move it.

00:17:13.040 --> 00:17:13.920
Go.

00:17:15.200 --> 00:17:15.880
Hurry up.

00:17:22.240 --> 00:17:23.280
Who is this person

00:17:23.599 --> 00:17:25.359
wearing shackles and handcuffs?

00:17:25.359 --> 00:17:28.280
This man is the sixth boss of the Sandaoyuan bandits.

00:17:28.280 --> 00:17:29.940
I originally wanted to use him

00:17:30.040 --> 00:17:31.920
to recruit more swordsmen for my use.

00:17:31.920 --> 00:17:34.160
But he'd rather die than submit,

00:17:34.520 --> 00:17:35.960
and he is highly skilled in martial arts.

00:17:35.960 --> 00:17:38.120
So I put shackles and handcuffs on him

00:17:38.520 --> 00:17:39.360
just in case.

00:17:39.760 --> 00:17:40.920
You did the right thing.

00:17:40.920 --> 00:17:42.720
For these disobedient Chinese,

00:17:42.920 --> 00:17:45.560
we should let them suffer more.

00:17:51.200 --> 00:17:52.120
Listen up!

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:53.720
Here,

00:17:54.160 --> 00:17:56.620
you are serving our Great Japanese Holy War.

00:17:56.680 --> 00:17:58.960
Only by completing the work here diligently

00:17:58.960 --> 00:18:01.160
can you qualify to leave.

00:18:01.520 --> 00:18:04.280
I advise you not to harbor any illusions.

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:06.640
For those who slack off

00:18:06.960 --> 00:18:08.200
or attempt to escape,

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:10.860
we will impose the severest punishment,

00:18:10.880 --> 00:18:12.210
even taking your lives.

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:13.760
Of course,

00:18:14.120 --> 00:18:16.650
for those who are hardworking and dedicated,

00:18:16.960 --> 00:18:19.200
we will also give appropriate rewards.

00:18:19.640 --> 00:18:21.440
I hope you behave yourselves.

00:18:21.920 --> 00:18:24.520
Take them inside and start working immediately.

00:18:24.520 --> 00:18:25.320
You.

00:18:25.840 --> 00:18:26.640
Hurry up.

00:18:28.320 --> 00:18:30.120
Mr. Tahara did an excellent job.

00:18:30.480 --> 00:18:31.480
With this gold mine,

00:18:31.480 --> 00:18:33.400
we can alleviate our army's

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:35.480
financial strain.

00:18:40.920 --> 00:18:43.480
Hurry up. Move faster.

00:18:45.040 --> 00:18:45.800
Keep moving.

00:18:51.400 --> 00:18:53.440
In this attack on Qinglong Stronghold,

00:18:53.440 --> 00:18:55.770
even though we blew up the enemy's armory,

00:18:56.360 --> 00:18:58.480
Master Liu and many of our brothers

00:18:58.680 --> 00:18:59.680
lost their lives.

00:19:02.920 --> 00:19:04.120
Now Chief Wu's fate

00:19:04.480 --> 00:19:05.560
is also unknown.

00:19:06.840 --> 00:19:10.000
I have been reflecting since I came back.

00:19:11.240 --> 00:19:13.040
My plan wasn't thorough enough.

00:19:13.600 --> 00:19:15.330
I bear a lot of responsibility.

00:19:16.600 --> 00:19:17.400
Baozi.

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:19.900
Victory and defeat are common in war.

00:19:20.000 --> 00:19:21.920
Sacrifices are inevitable in battle.

00:19:21.920 --> 00:19:22.480
Besides,

00:19:22.760 --> 00:19:24.000
your operation this time

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:25.730
dealt a heavy blow to Tianyuan.

00:19:26.400 --> 00:19:27.640
It wasn't a failure.

00:19:30.720 --> 00:19:31.600
Old Xu.

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:35.000
Seeing you puts my mind at ease.

00:19:36.120 --> 00:19:37.160
Let's discuss

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:38.280
our next move.

00:19:38.440 --> 00:19:39.160
Come.

00:19:42.640 --> 00:19:43.280
You're back.

00:19:43.280 --> 00:19:44.040
Miss.

00:19:44.520 --> 00:19:45.360
Baozi.

00:19:45.760 --> 00:19:46.880
Where have you two been?

00:19:46.880 --> 00:19:48.040
We were worried for a long time.

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:48.760
Yeah.

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:50.880
The Japanese are arresting people everywhere today.

00:19:50.880 --> 00:19:53.080
Yuanshangfei and I went to check it out,

00:19:53.160 --> 00:19:54.240
and found out

00:19:55.080 --> 00:19:56.800
the Japanese are mining for gold.

00:19:56.800 --> 00:19:58.660
And they also captured civilians

00:19:58.840 --> 00:20:00.100
to use as forced labor.

00:20:00.640 --> 00:20:02.240
We also saw Chief Wu.

00:20:02.560 --> 00:20:03.560
He is still alive.

00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:04.800
Uncle Liu is still alive.

00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:05.240
Yes.

00:20:05.480 --> 00:20:07.120
He looks like he suffered a lot,

00:20:07.120 --> 00:20:08.780
but luckily nothing serious.

00:20:11.040 --> 00:20:11.920
So,

00:20:12.320 --> 00:20:14.560
Masao Tahara found the location of the gold mine.

00:20:14.560 --> 00:20:15.840
It seems so for now.

00:20:18.240 --> 00:20:20.440
We can't let the Japs get away with this.

00:20:20.720 --> 00:20:21.650
We must find a way

00:20:21.920 --> 00:20:23.000
to take it back.

00:20:24.120 --> 00:20:26.520
Now that the Japanese army has occupied all of Sandaoyuan,

00:20:26.520 --> 00:20:28.780
taking back the gold mine is impossible.

00:20:28.920 --> 00:20:31.280
The only way is to destroy it.

00:20:31.760 --> 00:20:32.690
It's a good idea,

00:20:32.920 --> 00:20:34.640
but impossible to execute.

00:20:34.920 --> 00:20:38.720
The Japanese army is heavily guarding the area around the gold mine.

00:20:44.080 --> 00:20:46.200
This won't work, that won't work.

00:20:47.880 --> 00:20:50.280
The Japs have men, guns, and money.

00:20:50.560 --> 00:20:51.440
What do we have?

00:20:51.800 --> 00:20:53.600
Are we just waiting to be beaten?

00:20:53.720 --> 00:20:55.560
Losing the gold mine

00:20:56.080 --> 00:20:58.320
already makes me feel like I failed my father.

00:20:58.320 --> 00:21:00.520
If it really becomes the Japanese's funding,

00:21:00.520 --> 00:21:03.380
I won't have the face to see my father even when I die.

00:21:04.120 --> 00:21:06.120
Whether we are worthy of the Chief

00:21:06.440 --> 00:21:08.300
cannot be measured by a gold mine.

00:21:08.800 --> 00:21:11.930
But by carrying the resistance against Japan to the end.

00:21:12.880 --> 00:21:14.160
Wenpei is right.

00:21:15.240 --> 00:21:17.100
Although Sandaoyuan has fallen,

00:21:17.560 --> 00:21:19.960
Shanzhou City, Qinglong Stronghold, and Qinfoye Gully

00:21:19.960 --> 00:21:21.840
have also fallen into Japanese hands.

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:24.320
The resistance forces in our hands are also limited.

00:21:24.320 --> 00:21:27.160
But the other swordsmen in Sandaoyuan are still here.

00:21:27.160 --> 00:21:28.400
The vast majority of them

00:21:28.400 --> 00:21:29.920
are still resisting Japan.

00:21:29.920 --> 00:21:32.240
If we can unite them,

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:35.040
it will be a considerable resistance force.

00:21:35.040 --> 00:21:35.880
Right.

00:21:36.280 --> 00:21:37.680
Even a tiger takes a nap.

00:21:37.960 --> 00:21:38.890
I don't believe,

00:21:39.240 --> 00:21:41.480
with the Japs stretching their front lines so long,

00:21:41.480 --> 00:21:42.880
they can protect everything.

00:21:42.880 --> 00:21:45.810
When the time comes, we will target their weak spots.

00:21:47.920 --> 00:21:49.960
Tell me, how do we fight?

00:21:51.800 --> 00:21:54.040
Use our swordsmen's familiarity with the terrain

00:21:54.040 --> 00:21:56.520
to launch guerrilla attacks on the Japanese army.

00:21:56.520 --> 00:21:58.120
Block their main traffic routes,

00:21:58.120 --> 00:21:59.400
so their military supplies

00:21:59.400 --> 00:22:01.520
cannot smoothly pass through Sandaoyuan.

00:22:01.520 --> 00:22:03.440
As long as their main forces are unable to advance west,

00:22:03.440 --> 00:22:04.920
it is our victory.

00:22:06.600 --> 00:22:07.600
Yuanshangfei.

00:22:08.600 --> 00:22:10.000
We are good at this.

00:22:12.120 --> 00:22:13.400
Leave the gold mine to me.

00:22:13.400 --> 00:22:15.480
I'll find a way to sneak in,

00:22:15.960 --> 00:22:17.760
and scout the situation inside.

00:22:18.240 --> 00:22:20.040
Yes, let's do that.

00:22:32.920 --> 00:22:34.760
Baozi, the car is here.

00:22:37.800 --> 00:22:39.200
Right on time.

00:22:40.120 --> 00:22:41.720
Brothers, take cover on both sides.

00:22:41.720 --> 00:22:42.320
Hurry.

00:22:42.640 --> 00:22:43.170
Hurry up.

00:22:43.280 --> 00:22:44.540
Take cover, move fast.

00:23:20.520 --> 00:23:21.240
Fire!

00:23:54.480 --> 00:23:55.640
This is good stuff.

00:23:55.920 --> 00:23:56.920
I've wanted it for a long time.

00:23:56.920 --> 00:23:58.720
Finally got my hands on it today.

00:23:59.240 --> 00:24:00.160
What's this?

00:24:00.520 --> 00:24:02.120
When I was in the Eighth Route Army,

00:24:02.120 --> 00:24:04.480
I captured a Type 92 artillery from the Japanese.

00:24:04.480 --> 00:24:05.740
When that thing fired,

00:24:05.800 --> 00:24:07.800
it could blow off a corner of Shanzhou City.

00:24:07.800 --> 00:24:09.600
Aren't you going to give one to the eldest miss?

00:24:09.600 --> 00:24:10.760
Don't blame me for not reminding you.

00:24:10.760 --> 00:24:12.920
She has loved martial arts since she was a child.

00:24:12.920 --> 00:24:13.720
If you give her one,

00:24:13.720 --> 00:24:15.280
she will definitely be happy.

00:24:15.280 --> 00:24:16.280
Why give it to her?

00:24:16.560 --> 00:24:18.200
You didn't let her fight the ambush this morning,

00:24:18.200 --> 00:24:19.400
she sulked all morning.

00:24:19.400 --> 00:24:21.330
She tortured me a lot this morning.

00:24:21.360 --> 00:24:22.560
She is too impatient.

00:24:22.600 --> 00:24:24.600
She's not suitable for such a patient operation.

00:24:24.600 --> 00:24:27.160
There will be plenty of opportunities in the future.

00:24:27.160 --> 00:24:29.040
These things are collective property.

00:24:29.040 --> 00:24:30.840
When we go back, we have to distribute them according to needs.

00:24:30.840 --> 00:24:32.160
Yuanshangfei, your marksmanship is so accurate.

00:24:32.160 --> 00:24:34.290
It's a pity for you to use a machine gun.

00:24:34.760 --> 00:24:36.760
Don't even think about it this time.

00:24:37.600 --> 00:24:38.360
You kid.

00:24:38.480 --> 00:24:39.240
Boss.

00:24:42.120 --> 00:24:43.560
Boss, what is this?

00:24:45.160 --> 00:24:46.320
This is good stuff.

00:24:46.680 --> 00:24:47.600
It's called canned food.

00:24:47.600 --> 00:24:48.640
It's full of meat.

00:24:49.000 --> 00:24:50.720
When the Japanese army marches and fights,

00:24:50.720 --> 00:24:51.920
this is what they eat.

00:24:52.040 --> 00:24:52.900
The meat inside

00:24:53.040 --> 00:24:54.840
won't go bad for months.

00:24:55.440 --> 00:24:56.240
That's great.

00:24:56.440 --> 00:24:57.800
The brothers have been eating wild vegetables for several meals.

00:24:57.800 --> 00:24:59.660
Now we can finally have some meat.

00:25:00.080 --> 00:25:01.610
We can't stay here too long.

00:25:01.840 --> 00:25:03.320
Otherwise, it will be dangerous.

00:25:03.320 --> 00:25:05.380
Brothers, get in the car and let's go.

00:25:05.920 --> 00:25:06.840
Let's go.

00:25:23.080 --> 00:25:24.040
Report.

00:25:25.680 --> 00:25:27.160
Cai Baozi and his swordsmen

00:25:27.160 --> 00:25:28.640
blew up our supply truck.

00:25:29.360 --> 00:25:31.640
They are now fleeing towards Dawang Town.

00:25:31.640 --> 00:25:34.040
Our patrol is pursuing them.

00:25:35.440 --> 00:25:36.600
Bastards.

00:25:37.520 --> 00:25:39.680
This is the sixth time this month.

00:25:40.200 --> 00:25:43.040
The Communists are really annoying.

00:25:43.640 --> 00:25:45.200
Just like mosquitoes,

00:25:45.760 --> 00:25:48.360
they bite you when you're not paying attention.

00:25:48.360 --> 00:25:49.360
Pass on the order.

00:25:49.880 --> 00:25:53.480
Send another squadron to reinforce the patrol.

00:25:53.800 --> 00:25:58.360
If necessary, wipe out the villages and towns.

00:25:59.080 --> 00:26:00.560
Cai Baozi.

00:26:01.280 --> 00:26:04.680
I will send all your bandits to hell.

00:26:07.600 --> 00:26:08.730
Brigade Commander,

00:26:08.800 --> 00:26:10.460
I heard Zhang Gongyan is back.

00:26:12.400 --> 00:26:13.200
That was fast.

00:26:13.320 --> 00:26:14.600
They say he was snubbed

00:26:14.960 --> 00:26:16.480
and came back furious.

00:26:20.520 --> 00:26:21.580
And another thing.

00:26:21.920 --> 00:26:23.400
The Japanese army in Dawang Town area

00:26:23.400 --> 00:26:25.460
clashed with Cai Baozi's swordsmen.

00:26:29.120 --> 00:26:29.880
Oh no.

00:26:31.240 --> 00:26:33.600
Cai Baozi and his men are targeted by the Japanese.

00:26:33.600 --> 00:26:34.920
Cai Baozi initiated it

00:26:35.240 --> 00:26:37.400
and destroyed the Japanese supply convoy.

00:26:37.400 --> 00:26:38.600
What was he thinking?

00:26:38.920 --> 00:26:41.720
Having swordsmen fight the Japanese with broadswords and matchlocks?

00:26:41.720 --> 00:26:43.080
You know him.

00:26:43.520 --> 00:26:45.480
He'd storm Luoyang single-handedly.

00:26:45.480 --> 00:26:47.800
He'd ambush Qinglong Mountain with just a few swords.

00:26:47.800 --> 00:26:49.760
Let alone a convoy.

00:26:50.080 --> 00:26:51.720
He's got guts.

00:26:52.240 --> 00:26:53.170
How are they now?

00:26:53.240 --> 00:26:54.920
Currently, Cai Baozi is trapped

00:26:54.920 --> 00:26:56.680
in a village west of Dawang Town.

00:26:56.680 --> 00:26:58.410
The situation is against them.

00:27:00.360 --> 00:27:01.080
No.

00:27:01.320 --> 00:27:01.720
No.

00:27:01.760 --> 00:27:03.440
Cai Zhen might still be there.

00:27:03.760 --> 00:27:05.480
Assemble the troops and get ready to move out anytime.

00:27:05.480 --> 00:27:06.720
Why is Cai Zhen there?

00:27:08.920 --> 00:27:10.120
Division Commander,

00:27:11.440 --> 00:27:14.320
where are you going with my men?

00:27:14.600 --> 00:27:16.280
Division Commander, I heard you were back.

00:27:16.280 --> 00:27:17.840
I didn't have time to see you yet.

00:27:17.840 --> 00:27:18.760
Division Commander, I have an emergency.

00:27:18.760 --> 00:27:20.020
I need to save someone.

00:27:21.800 --> 00:27:25.720
To save communists like Cai Zhen and Cai Baozi?

00:27:27.120 --> 00:27:29.240
Have you lost your mind?

00:27:29.760 --> 00:27:32.360
What does their life or death have to do with us?

00:27:32.400 --> 00:27:34.080
Is it worth it for just a few of them

00:27:34.080 --> 00:27:36.040
to risk our lives fighting the Japanese?

00:27:36.040 --> 00:27:36.800
Yes.

00:27:37.480 --> 00:27:38.680
They are communists.

00:27:39.600 --> 00:27:41.240
But they are fighting the Japanese too.

00:27:41.240 --> 00:27:44.000
They are fighting bloody battles against the Japs.

00:27:44.000 --> 00:27:45.800
We can't just sit and do nothing.

00:27:45.960 --> 00:27:49.420
The Japanese have long wanted to swallow up our 16th Division.

00:27:50.160 --> 00:27:52.600
Wouldn't we be walking right into a trap if we go now?

00:27:52.600 --> 00:27:54.040
We are soldiers.

00:27:54.680 --> 00:27:56.440
Soldiers should defend their country.

00:27:56.440 --> 00:27:57.400
Commander.

00:27:57.840 --> 00:27:59.600
Shanzhou City has already been lost.

00:27:59.600 --> 00:28:02.200
If we don't show up for a small battle like this,

00:28:03.920 --> 00:28:05.580
are we worthy of this uniform?

00:28:06.720 --> 00:28:08.760
If you want to gain a foothold in the army

00:28:08.760 --> 00:28:10.280
and speak with confidence,

00:28:10.280 --> 00:28:11.800
you rely on strength.

00:28:12.520 --> 00:28:13.880
As long as you have strength,

00:28:13.880 --> 00:28:15.760
others will look up to you.

00:28:16.200 --> 00:28:17.320
This 16th Division

00:28:17.760 --> 00:28:19.400
is what I have worked hard for so many years

00:28:19.400 --> 00:28:20.520
to build up.

00:28:20.880 --> 00:28:22.240
If they're wiped out

00:28:22.840 --> 00:28:23.840
and swallowed up,

00:28:24.160 --> 00:28:26.520
what responsibility is there to talk about?

00:28:26.520 --> 00:28:29.720
This matter isn't worth it no matter how you calculate it.

00:28:32.880 --> 00:28:33.960
Not worth it.

00:28:35.840 --> 00:28:36.840
Commander Zhang.

00:28:37.400 --> 00:28:38.880
A soldier's duty

00:28:39.440 --> 00:28:41.880
is a business in your eyes.

00:28:42.360 --> 00:28:43.040
Okay.

00:28:43.320 --> 00:28:45.040
I give the 16th Division back to you.

00:28:45.040 --> 00:28:46.160
I'll take my leave.

00:28:47.360 --> 00:28:48.490
Where are you going?

00:28:49.560 --> 00:28:52.480
Commander Zhang, your 16th Division is too precious.

00:28:52.480 --> 00:28:53.810
I can't afford to use it.

00:28:54.160 --> 00:28:56.490
I'm going back to my Independent Brigade.

00:28:56.680 --> 00:28:58.800
Cui Wenkui, don't forget.

00:29:00.000 --> 00:29:02.800
Your Independent Brigade is also under the dispatch of my 16th Division.

00:29:02.800 --> 00:29:05.400
You also have to obey my orders.

00:29:08.480 --> 00:29:09.320
Yes.

00:29:09.960 --> 00:29:11.620
Soldiers should obey orders.

00:29:12.000 --> 00:29:13.880
But I would rather die on the battlefield

00:29:13.880 --> 00:29:16.010
than be a slave of a subjugated nation.

00:29:16.480 --> 00:29:17.360
Cui Wenkui.

00:29:17.840 --> 00:29:20.080
Don't think your high-sounding words

00:29:20.400 --> 00:29:22.600
can cover up your shameful secrets.

00:29:22.920 --> 00:29:24.640
I have already investigated it clearly.

00:29:24.640 --> 00:29:26.320
That Communist named Cai Zhen

00:29:26.640 --> 00:29:28.960
is your biological sister, Cui Wenpei.

00:29:30.040 --> 00:29:30.920
Her identity is

00:29:31.280 --> 00:29:34.160
the special commissioner of the Eighth Route Army's office in western Henan.

00:29:34.160 --> 00:29:36.760
When you escorted her to the prison,

00:29:37.120 --> 00:29:38.520
you were knocked out.

00:29:39.080 --> 00:29:40.610
That was you letting her go.

00:29:41.200 --> 00:29:42.560
At first,

00:29:43.360 --> 00:29:45.240
I thought you had a deep brother-sister bond

00:29:45.240 --> 00:29:46.720
and you were just momentarily confused.

00:29:46.720 --> 00:29:47.760
Only now do I know

00:29:47.960 --> 00:29:50.960
that you have truly been communized by the Communist Party.

00:29:50.960 --> 00:29:53.220
How dare you openly defy your superiors.

00:29:54.280 --> 00:29:55.200
Men!

00:29:59.760 --> 00:30:01.480
Arrest Cui Wenkui!

00:30:01.680 --> 00:30:03.080
I'd like to see who dares!

00:30:08.320 --> 00:30:09.360
I, Cui Wenkui,

00:30:10.560 --> 00:30:11.440
have never done anything

00:30:11.440 --> 00:30:13.480
to betray the Party and the State.

00:30:15.800 --> 00:30:16.800
I will go with you.

00:30:18.200 --> 00:30:19.080
Take him away.

00:30:20.360 --> 00:30:21.240
Commander.

00:30:47.120 --> 00:30:47.920
Commander.

00:30:48.880 --> 00:30:49.720
Here.

00:30:55.280 --> 00:30:56.760
Go call that bastard

00:30:56.880 --> 00:30:57.800
Zhang Gongyan here.

00:30:57.800 --> 00:30:58.200
Yes, sir.

00:30:58.200 --> 00:30:59.840
I'll shoot him dead.

00:31:00.040 --> 00:31:00.900
That's enough.

00:31:03.440 --> 00:31:04.200
Get out.

00:31:14.960 --> 00:31:16.360
What are you doing?

00:31:17.280 --> 00:31:18.440
You need to calm down.

00:31:18.440 --> 00:31:20.280
You are my adjutant now.

00:31:20.720 --> 00:31:23.120
With me gone, the whole unit depends on you.

00:31:23.400 --> 00:31:24.320
If something happens to you,

00:31:24.320 --> 00:31:25.760
what will our brothers do?

00:31:25.760 --> 00:31:26.560
Commander.

00:31:27.400 --> 00:31:29.730
There is no Independent Brigade anymore.

00:31:29.840 --> 00:31:32.370
Zhang Gongyan's men have long controlled it.

00:31:33.440 --> 00:31:37.640
He's telling everyone you're a traitor.

00:31:41.320 --> 00:31:43.520
The brothers don't know what to do.

00:31:48.640 --> 00:31:49.600
Sit down.

00:31:51.160 --> 00:31:52.640
Sit.

00:31:57.080 --> 00:31:59.080
How many years have you been with me?

00:31:59.680 --> 00:32:00.560
Eight years.

00:32:03.000 --> 00:32:03.960
Eight years.

00:32:09.920 --> 00:32:12.380
I have to be honest with you about something.

00:32:13.560 --> 00:32:16.200
Zhang Gongyan said Cai Zhen is a Communist.

00:32:16.680 --> 00:32:17.480
He's right.

00:32:20.280 --> 00:32:23.520
Cai Zhen is the one I told you about,

00:32:23.760 --> 00:32:26.320
my biological sister I've been looking for,

00:32:26.840 --> 00:32:27.960
Cui Wenpei.

00:32:30.840 --> 00:32:32.480
So I went soft.

00:32:32.920 --> 00:32:34.760
Yes, she is a Communist.

00:32:36.880 --> 00:32:37.840
But I had no choice.

00:32:37.840 --> 00:32:39.320
She is my sister.

00:32:39.320 --> 00:32:40.840
I had to help her.

00:32:42.360 --> 00:32:44.290
An eldest brother is like a father.

00:32:44.960 --> 00:32:46.280
Can you understand?

00:32:48.000 --> 00:32:49.880
But don't worry about this.

00:32:51.240 --> 00:32:53.080
I, Cui Wenkui, will never implicate

00:32:53.080 --> 00:32:55.280
any brothers in our brigade.

00:32:56.280 --> 00:32:59.280
As long as I stand firm against Zhang Gongyan,

00:32:59.760 --> 00:33:01.280
he won't do anything to me.

00:33:01.760 --> 00:33:03.680
When the higher-ups send someone down,

00:33:03.680 --> 00:33:07.400
Zhang Gongyan won't be arrogant for long.

00:33:10.800 --> 00:33:12.480
He won't do anything to you?

00:33:13.000 --> 00:33:14.920
Look at how badly you were beaten.

00:33:19.920 --> 00:33:21.400
You are the Commander.

00:33:22.360 --> 00:33:24.480
And he still dared to hit you so hard.

00:33:24.840 --> 00:33:27.320
If, and I mean if,

00:33:28.080 --> 00:33:30.480
before the Commander orders your release,

00:33:30.880 --> 00:33:33.160
Zhang Gongyan does something to harm you again,

00:33:33.160 --> 00:33:34.160
what should we do?

00:33:39.680 --> 00:33:41.840
I believe there is still justice.

00:33:42.080 --> 00:33:44.210
Zhang Gongyan is a minority after all.

00:33:46.800 --> 00:33:47.880
Justice?

00:33:49.320 --> 00:33:51.480
If there was justice,

00:33:52.040 --> 00:33:54.080
would you still be here?

00:34:00.200 --> 00:34:01.040
Commander.

00:34:02.600 --> 00:34:05.400
You gave me this life.

00:34:05.840 --> 00:34:08.679
You carried me out of the dead bodies.

00:34:10.159 --> 00:34:12.120
You trained me yourself.

00:34:13.920 --> 00:34:14.960
In my eyes,

00:34:17.400 --> 00:34:19.000
there is only your kindness.

00:34:21.480 --> 00:34:24.199
I can do anything for you.

00:34:27.400 --> 00:34:28.480
Come back.

00:34:37.480 --> 00:34:39.000
What a fool.

00:34:42.760 --> 00:34:44.880
Thank goodness you got out unscathed this time.

00:34:44.880 --> 00:34:46.480
This gun I've wanted for so long,

00:34:46.480 --> 00:34:47.739
I finally captured it.

00:34:48.080 --> 00:34:50.080
What gun? Not going to give it to me?

00:34:53.520 --> 00:34:54.239
Nothing.

00:34:54.639 --> 00:34:56.719
Yuanshang Fei, give yours to me.

00:34:57.520 --> 00:34:58.240
Miss.

00:34:58.480 --> 00:35:00.040
Anyway, I can't give you mine.

00:35:00.040 --> 00:35:01.120
I captured two of them at the time.

00:35:01.120 --> 00:35:01.720
I took one,

00:35:01.800 --> 00:35:02.680
and Baozi took the other.

00:35:02.680 --> 00:35:03.960
He said he would give that one to you.

00:35:03.960 --> 00:35:06.760
But he turned around and gave it to that swordsman.

00:35:07.640 --> 00:35:08.680
Really?

00:35:10.440 --> 00:35:11.640
Come here, come here.

00:35:11.720 --> 00:35:13.080
Explain it to me clearly.

00:35:13.080 --> 00:35:14.010
Have some water.

00:35:14.480 --> 00:35:15.320
No.

00:35:15.560 --> 00:35:17.680
Yuanshangfei, I think you have

00:35:17.680 --> 00:35:19.440
the potential to be a traitor.

00:35:19.920 --> 00:35:21.450
I told you not to mention it.

00:35:21.600 --> 00:35:23.000
Why did you sell me out behind my back?

00:35:23.000 --> 00:35:23.480
I...

00:35:23.680 --> 00:35:25.360
Okay, I see how it is.

00:35:25.720 --> 00:35:27.720
Ganging up on me, huh?

00:35:28.720 --> 00:35:30.560
If you don't get me a better one anyway,

00:35:30.560 --> 00:35:31.760
you have to give me yours.

00:35:31.760 --> 00:35:32.120
Fine.

00:35:32.240 --> 00:35:33.480
I'll get you one next time.

00:35:33.480 --> 00:35:34.540
Commissioner Cui.

00:35:34.720 --> 00:35:37.080
Adjutant Zhu from the Independent Brigade is here to see you.

00:35:37.080 --> 00:35:37.880
Wenpei.

00:35:38.360 --> 00:35:40.080
Please save our brigade commander.

00:35:40.080 --> 00:35:41.200
What happened?

00:35:42.280 --> 00:35:44.680
Our commander heard that your guerrillas

00:35:45.160 --> 00:35:47.520
were fighting the Japanese around Dawang Town.

00:35:47.520 --> 00:35:48.980
He wanted to come and help.

00:35:49.000 --> 00:35:50.530
Who knew that Zhang Gongyan

00:35:50.600 --> 00:35:52.200
got a rebuff from somewhere,

00:35:52.560 --> 00:35:54.760
and took his anger out on our commander.

00:35:55.880 --> 00:35:58.010
He arrested him as soon as he came back.

00:35:58.240 --> 00:35:59.240
What did you say?

00:36:00.600 --> 00:36:01.920
Zhang Gongyan arrested Cui Wenkui?

00:36:01.920 --> 00:36:02.680
Yes.

00:36:03.080 --> 00:36:05.600
He said it was because of Wenpei's influence

00:36:06.040 --> 00:36:07.160
that he betrayed the party and joined the Communists.

00:36:07.160 --> 00:36:09.620
He is now locked in prison and being tortured

00:36:10.200 --> 00:36:11.460
to force our commander

00:36:12.240 --> 00:36:14.040
into making a false confession.

00:36:14.040 --> 00:36:15.120
This Zhang Gongyan

00:36:15.480 --> 00:36:17.680
It's not the first time he's made things difficult for my brother.

00:36:17.680 --> 00:36:19.010
Now he's doing it again.

00:36:19.480 --> 00:36:21.120
Although this trick looks old-fashioned,

00:36:21.120 --> 00:36:22.320
it is very effective.

00:36:23.040 --> 00:36:24.000
The Kuomintang has always been afraid

00:36:24.000 --> 00:36:26.000
of the growing strength of the Communist Party.

00:36:26.000 --> 00:36:27.960
Many officers

00:36:28.200 --> 00:36:29.640
have been imprisoned for being pro-Communist.

00:36:29.640 --> 00:36:32.570
Our commander hasn't seen through their tricks yet.

00:36:32.640 --> 00:36:35.080
He still thinks the higher-ups will give him justice.

00:36:35.080 --> 00:36:37.040
But I know clearly

00:36:37.440 --> 00:36:40.760
that Zhang Gongyan won't let him go this time.

00:36:41.760 --> 00:36:43.220
He is going to be ruthless.

00:36:46.640 --> 00:36:48.600
Before, when I was a Juntong major,

00:36:48.920 --> 00:36:50.450
there might have been a way.

00:36:50.680 --> 00:36:52.080
Now that my identity is exposed,

00:36:52.080 --> 00:36:53.760
it's very hard to intervene.

00:36:54.240 --> 00:36:56.800
Moreover, the Party organization strictly requires

00:36:56.800 --> 00:36:58.640
us to maintain the overall situation of the resistance.

00:36:58.640 --> 00:37:01.160
We can't have any friction with the Kuomintang,

00:37:01.160 --> 00:37:02.520
to avoid giving the Japanese an opportunity

00:37:02.520 --> 00:37:04.120
for their westward advance.

00:37:05.120 --> 00:37:06.920
Even if I want to save my brother,

00:37:08.040 --> 00:37:09.840
I can't find a suitable way.

00:37:14.000 --> 00:37:14.880
If,

00:37:17.000 --> 00:37:18.600
if none of you can help,

00:37:20.080 --> 00:37:22.680
then no one can save our commander.

00:37:24.440 --> 00:37:25.760
Let me think about it.

00:37:28.280 --> 00:37:29.040
Xu,

00:37:29.480 --> 00:37:31.320
take Adjutant Zhu to rest first.

00:37:32.400 --> 00:37:33.280
Alright.

00:37:34.840 --> 00:37:36.170
Let's go, Adjutant Zhu.

00:37:37.040 --> 00:37:37.880
It's fine.

00:37:48.840 --> 00:37:50.200
I wonder how Wenkui

00:37:50.480 --> 00:37:51.800
is doing right now.

00:37:53.640 --> 00:37:55.240
Baozi, I can tell

00:37:55.480 --> 00:37:57.610
that Wenpei wants to save her brother.

00:37:57.800 --> 00:37:58.640
Yes.

00:37:59.880 --> 00:38:03.400
But some bottom lines cannot be crossed.

00:38:03.600 --> 00:38:05.640
Crossing them will cause chaos,

00:38:06.240 --> 00:38:07.920
and more people will get hurt.

00:38:08.560 --> 00:38:10.960
No one can afford this price.

00:38:11.720 --> 00:38:13.440
Is this what my father meant

00:38:13.840 --> 00:38:15.360
by 'loyalty and righteousness cannot both be preserved'?

00:38:15.360 --> 00:38:16.160
Exactly.

00:38:17.960 --> 00:38:19.890
When I was in the Eighth Route Army,

00:38:20.560 --> 00:38:24.040
I often saw my comrades surrounded by the enemy.

00:38:25.160 --> 00:38:26.640
But because we had missions,

00:38:26.640 --> 00:38:28.240
we couldn't go and save them.

00:38:28.240 --> 00:38:30.760
Until the moment of their sacrifice,

00:38:31.360 --> 00:38:34.280
these comrades couldn't even see their families one last time.

00:38:34.280 --> 00:38:36.160
Sacrificing one's own family for the greater good

00:38:36.160 --> 00:38:37.760
is not what we wish for.

00:38:38.320 --> 00:38:39.520
If not,

00:38:39.840 --> 00:38:42.320
our country won't see the light.

00:38:42.880 --> 00:38:44.140
I understand all that.

00:38:45.440 --> 00:38:47.360
But I can't bear to see her suffer.

00:38:49.120 --> 00:38:50.360
I am not in the Eighth Route Army.

00:38:50.360 --> 00:38:52.090
I can still save people, right?

00:38:54.360 --> 00:38:55.400
Seems so.

00:38:55.800 --> 00:38:56.600
Okay.

00:38:57.000 --> 00:38:58.530
Then I'll take my brothers.

00:38:58.800 --> 00:39:01.080
I'll take the blame if anything happens.

00:39:05.320 --> 00:39:08.200
Cui Wenpei must not know about this.

00:39:09.080 --> 00:39:10.410
It must be done quietly.

00:39:10.720 --> 00:39:11.760
So you mean...

00:39:12.160 --> 00:39:13.480
I'll go with you.

00:39:14.000 --> 00:39:14.960
You...

00:39:18.760 --> 00:39:21.160
I, Shangguan Ying, was not wrong about you.

00:39:23.040 --> 00:39:24.160
My man

00:39:25.440 --> 00:39:26.880
is indeed righteous and loyal.